'''Frozen''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2019 Christmas box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is icy blue in color with a frozen ice texture over it, hence the name. The guard is gray, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
*It has a [[Frozen (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Frozen_Set Frozen Set].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]]. {{UncommonsNav}}

